WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.152
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.422 --> 00:49.591
Just make sure there's no evidence.

3
00:49.674 --> 00:52.927
A brokenhearted man and a grieving son who just couldn't take it anymore.

4
00:53.011 --> 00:55.096
They'll all think the same thing.

5
00:55.180 --> 00:56.931
You can't make a mistake.

6
00:57.015 --> 00:58.141
No one will ever know.

7
00:58.224 --> 00:59.517
End it well.

8
01:04.230 --> 01:05.774
We already know who killed him.

9
01:05.857 --> 01:06.775
So what's the problem?

10
01:06.858 --> 01:08.985
Dad is gone. He can't tell us what he wants anymore.

11
01:09.069 --> 01:12.363
So don't use his name to justify

12
01:12.447 --> 01:16.326
something that you want to do.

13
01:17.368 --> 01:18.995
You want me to kill Brother Mikoy?

14
01:19.079 --> 01:20.789
If Sianong fails,

15
01:33.968 --> 01:35.011
Carlota.

16
01:36.221 --> 01:37.222
Don't talk to me.

17
01:37.305 --> 01:38.515
We're done.

18
01:38.598 --> 01:39.390
Sianong!

19
01:41.976 --> 01:43.311
Let Carlota go.

20
01:43.394 --> 01:44.729
No one's going to chase you.

21
01:44.813 --> 01:45.855
Let her go.

22
01:56.241 --> 01:57.325
-Carlota. -Run after him!

23
02:01.579 --> 02:03.623
I'm still wondering how Agent Sianong did that.

24
02:03.706 --> 02:04.874
Me too, I still can't understand.

25
02:05.708 --> 02:08.002
I don't know why we have to guard him.

26
02:08.086 --> 02:11.881
And why he had to betray us.

27
02:11.965 --> 02:14.801
Remember, he likes to read that book-- What is it again?

28
02:53.548 --> 02:54.716
Yes.

29
02:54.799 --> 02:57.510
I still can't believe he did that.

30
02:58.177 --> 02:59.429
What did you think?

31
02:59.512 --> 03:00.388
I don't know.

32
03:02.849 --> 03:03.933
Have you seen Sianong?

33
03:04.017 --> 03:07.186
Ma'am, we've been here for a while, and we haven't seen him.

34
03:07.270 --> 03:08.563
Alex.

35
03:08.646 --> 03:10.481
He might have gone through here.

36
03:10.565 --> 03:11.482
Let's go.

37
03:11.566 --> 03:13.443
Stay here and let us know if you see him.

38
03:13.526 --> 03:14.736
-Yes, ma'am. -Okay, ma'am.

39
03:17.405 --> 03:18.615
Cocoy.

40
03:19.532 --> 03:20.658
-Wake up. -Ouch!

41
03:21.868 --> 03:23.077
Easy.

42
03:23.161 --> 03:24.454
What happened?

43
03:26.581 --> 03:27.665
Where's Sianong?

44
03:27.749 --> 03:28.833
It was him.

45
03:29.876 --> 03:30.752
He's the mole.

46
03:35.715 --> 03:36.674
Where is he?

47
03:36.758 --> 03:38.092
He escaped.

48
03:41.179 --> 03:42.222
How about Mikoy?

49
03:42.305 --> 03:43.765
He's with Alex.

50
03:43.848 --> 03:45.016
They're after him.

51
04:05.453 --> 04:06.371
Yes?

52
04:10.291 --> 04:11.876
What happened?

53
04:13.920 --> 04:15.129
Mikoy is still alive.

54
04:17.674 --> 04:18.549
How?

55
04:19.300 --> 04:21.552
I just got a little too complacent,

56
04:21.636 --> 04:24.639
and there was also a lack of judgment on my end.

57
04:25.348 --> 04:28.977
Maybe that's why they kind of outsmarted me.

58
04:29.560 --> 04:30.561
A little?

59
04:40.822 --> 04:41.864
Alex, go ahead.

60
04:41.948 --> 04:43.658
I'll stay here for now. I'll follow you.

61
04:43.741 --> 04:44.784
Okay.

62
04:52.125 --> 04:53.459
They're after me.

63
05:03.886 --> 05:04.846
Vicky!

64
05:04.929 --> 05:06.639
What do you mean?

65
05:07.265 --> 05:09.350
You know what I mean.

66
05:11.019 --> 05:13.229
I don't understand what you're saying.

67
05:17.984 --> 05:20.403
After everything I've done for you, for this mission,

68
05:20.486 --> 05:22.280
for your grand mission, Vicky.

69
05:27.201 --> 05:28.328
Do you know what I did?

70
05:28.411 --> 05:30.288
I fucked everything up for this mission.

71
05:30.371 --> 05:31.581
I fucked over the agency.

72
05:31.664 --> 05:35.126
I fucked over everyone who cared about me.

73
05:35.209 --> 05:37.253
And you knew all the risks!

74
05:42.592 --> 05:43.551
So what now?

75
05:44.343 --> 05:45.303
That's it?

76
05:46.387 --> 05:47.889
Was that all for nothing?

77
05:50.058 --> 05:51.642
No one forced you.

78
05:51.726 --> 05:53.061
You chose this.

79
05:53.978 --> 05:56.606
Because you made me feel like I mattered, Vicky.

80
05:56.689 --> 05:58.775
That I could take revenge for Alice.

81
05:58.858 --> 06:02.070
That everything we were doing would lead to something.

82
06:02.153 --> 06:03.696
That it would go somewhere,

83
06:03.780 --> 06:06.908
and that I was part of all this.

84
06:06.991 --> 06:08.201
You mattered

85
06:08.284 --> 06:10.244
when you were still useful to me.

86
06:12.246 --> 06:13.122
Vicky!

87
06:13.206 --> 06:14.916
This is where it ends, Sianong.

88
06:15.500 --> 06:17.126
No, Vicky.

89
06:17.210 --> 06:18.294
Vicky.

90
06:52.203 --> 06:53.496
Surrender now.

91
06:58.459 --> 07:01.087
Come with us and face what you've done.

92
07:03.506 --> 07:05.007
You have nowhere else to go.

93
07:31.367 --> 07:32.326
Sianong, that's enough!

94
07:33.995 --> 07:34.912
Alex!

95
07:40.793 --> 07:41.919
Bok, that's enough!

96
07:52.180 --> 07:54.432
Mom?

97
07:54.515 --> 07:56.601
-We need to leave. -Why?

98
07:56.684 --> 07:57.894
We're compromised.

99
07:57.977 --> 07:58.978
How about Sianong?

100
07:59.061 --> 08:00.688
We'll deal with him later.

101
08:00.771 --> 08:01.939
What if he talks?

102
08:02.023 --> 08:05.193
He already knows what will happen to him if he does.

103
08:05.276 --> 08:07.195
Let's go. Get your things.

104
08:13.034 --> 08:14.368
What now, Mikoy?

105
08:18.956 --> 08:20.041
Sianong.

106
08:21.501 --> 08:23.002
It doesn't have to end this way.

107
08:29.175 --> 08:30.259
You're angry?

108
08:37.308 --> 08:38.476
Think about Chiara.

109
08:39.310 --> 08:41.062
Think about your father!

110
08:53.324 --> 08:54.242
What?

111
08:58.663 --> 08:59.997
you still can't hurt me?

112
09:03.834 --> 09:04.919
That's enough, Bok!

113
09:06.462 --> 09:07.588
I don't want to hurt you.

114
09:15.096 --> 09:17.181
Oh, really? Huh?

115
09:26.899 --> 09:27.900
Sianong!

116
09:29.318 --> 09:30.945
Sianong! Hold on!

117
09:31.028 --> 09:32.446
Why?

118
09:35.199 --> 09:37.076
Why are you saving me?

119
09:37.618 --> 09:39.078
What kind of question is that?!

120
09:39.161 --> 09:40.288
Help me!

121
09:42.081 --> 09:42.957
Hold on!

122
09:44.959 --> 09:45.918
Sianong!

123
09:47.378 --> 09:48.254
Hold on!

124
09:48.337 --> 09:49.380
Bok.

125
09:56.095 --> 09:57.972
There's no going back for me, Bok.

126
09:58.055 --> 10:00.349
No! There is! Just hold on!

127
10:02.935 --> 10:05.271
I know you two are my friends.

128
10:05.354 --> 10:06.606
Right?

129
10:06.689 --> 10:08.649
But I screwed you both.

130
10:08.733 --> 10:09.900
That's enough!

131
10:09.984 --> 10:11.944
Give me one of your hands. Reach it out to me, please!

132
10:12.028 --> 10:13.112
Reach it out, Sianong!

133
10:13.195 --> 10:14.113
Mikoy.

134
10:14.989 --> 10:16.991
It's not too late for Chiara.

135
10:18.951 --> 10:22.079
Chiara isn't the one who's responsible for all of this.

136
10:24.874 --> 10:26.250
It's Vicky.

137
10:27.001 --> 10:29.462
Vicky is behind all of this.

138
10:30.212 --> 10:32.131
You two go to Italy!

139
10:32.965 --> 10:34.925
Can you do that later, Sianong?

140
10:35.009 --> 10:36.135
Hold on!

141
10:37.678 --> 10:39.013
Hold on!

142
10:39.847 --> 10:40.848
Sianong.

143
10:43.893 --> 10:44.977
-Sianong. -Bok.

144
10:49.106 --> 10:51.067
-Sianong, hold on. -But…

145
10:51.150 --> 10:52.610
I'm tired.

146
10:57.698 --> 10:58.574
Sianong!

147
10:58.658 --> 11:00.159
Sianong, don't!

148
11:00.242 --> 11:01.077
Don't do that!

149
11:02.036 --> 11:03.037
Sianong!

150
11:07.708 --> 11:08.834
Sianong!

151
11:09.919 --> 11:13.005
Sianong!

152
12:16.777 --> 12:20.030
I never thought Sianong's story would end like this.

153
12:21.866 --> 12:23.075
I'm not used to it.

154
12:23.159 --> 12:24.201
The silence.

155
12:24.910 --> 12:26.954
No one's correcting us anymore.

156
12:28.581 --> 12:32.209
No one's suddenly going to say, "According to the 7 habits."

157
12:33.002 --> 12:36.005
Then it will lead to a 20-minute discussion.

158
12:37.131 --> 12:39.633
And somehow end up talking about Lord of the Rings.

159
12:43.762 --> 12:46.223
Everything somehow ends up with him talking about Lord of the Rings.

160
12:52.771 --> 12:54.732
He always used to tell me

161
12:56.192 --> 12:57.359
to think first.

162
12:59.361 --> 13:00.905
Don't act rashly.

163
13:03.073 --> 13:04.366
Follow the plan.

164
13:05.826 --> 13:07.203
Follow the rules.

165
13:11.624 --> 13:12.833
It's annoying.

166
13:15.586 --> 13:17.463
He was always right.

167
13:20.007 --> 13:21.634
That's why I don't understand

168
13:22.468 --> 13:24.512
why he let things get that far.

169
13:27.264 --> 13:29.141
We couldn't sleep last night either.

170
13:29.225 --> 13:32.019
Agent Alex and I went through everything.

171
13:32.102 --> 13:34.104
The records he was involved in.

172
13:34.188 --> 13:38.150
Just to see where we went wrong,

173
13:38.234 --> 13:39.818
what we missed.

174
13:55.834 --> 13:57.962
Do you know about Sianong?

175
14:07.680 --> 14:08.764
Imagine,

176
14:09.306 --> 14:11.600
she already had someone inside GAGO,

177
14:29.535 --> 14:31.412
And that's what worries us, dear.

178
14:34.915 --> 14:36.750
We don't know who her contacts are,

179
14:37.459 --> 14:39.128
or how she got in, right?

180
14:40.045 --> 14:43.674
And who are the people working under her?

181
14:43.757 --> 14:44.758
We have no idea.

182
14:56.687 --> 14:59.899
Apparently, Sianong loved someone who became a victim of human trafficking.

183
15:02.026 --> 15:03.569
And he wasn't able to save her.

184
15:04.904 --> 15:06.572
He wasn't able to get justice for her either.

185
15:08.616 --> 15:10.367
He never told me.

186
15:11.785 --> 15:13.329
None of us knew.

187
15:15.706 --> 15:17.958
But what Sianong did was wrong.

188
15:18.542 --> 15:20.085
He betrayed us.

189
15:20.836 --> 15:23.005
He tried to kill Mikoy.

190
15:24.173 --> 15:26.967
But I don't want that to be what we remember him by.

191
15:29.386 --> 15:30.930
Sianong was a good person.

192
15:32.890 --> 15:34.266
He just lost his way.

193
15:37.269 --> 15:38.604
I wish he had told us.

194
15:40.314 --> 15:43.609
I wish he had given us a chance to help him.

195
15:45.861 --> 15:49.031
But that doesn't justify betraying us.

196
15:50.532 --> 15:51.408
It doesn't.

197
15:52.493 --> 15:56.205
But that's the reason why Vicky was able to use him.

198
15:57.289 --> 15:58.832
He was used as a weapon.

199
16:00.125 --> 16:03.879
He was also a victim of a system that made him believe he had no other choice.

200
16:04.964 --> 16:06.840
I'm not saying what he did was right.

201
16:07.466 --> 16:10.177
But if we don't want what happened to Sianong to happen again,

202
16:10.260 --> 16:12.513
we need to bring down the system

203
16:12.596 --> 16:14.473
that creates people like him.

204
16:17.017 --> 16:18.227
And the Concordat.

205
16:28.862 --> 16:29.780
Dear.

206
16:31.782 --> 16:34.743
If she can plant someone

207
16:34.827 --> 16:36.453
inside GAGO,

208
16:38.163 --> 16:40.082
then she can also plant someone

209
16:41.250 --> 16:42.376
right beside you.

210
16:51.927 --> 16:53.012
What?

211
17:31.383 --> 17:32.926
Wherever he is now,

212
17:34.803 --> 17:37.014
I hope he found the peace

213
17:37.097 --> 17:38.932
he couldn't find here.

214
17:40.851 --> 17:42.978
Before he let go, he told us something.

215
17:46.315 --> 17:47.733
Let's go to Italy.

216
17:53.781 --> 17:55.199
What's in Italy?

217
17:56.408 --> 17:58.160
That's what we need to find out.

218
18:15.302 --> 18:16.428
Nothing.

219
18:22.017 --> 18:23.018
Absolutely nothing.

220
18:23.102 --> 18:24.812
No contacts for Sianong there,

221
18:24.895 --> 18:25.979
no accounts,

222
18:26.063 --> 18:28.816
not even any recent travel records.

223
18:29.399 --> 18:31.485
But he said it himself, Italy.

224
18:34.822 --> 18:36.532
Maybe we're missing something.

225
18:37.658 --> 18:39.326
Where's Carlota, by the way?

226
18:42.579 --> 18:43.580
Thank you.

227
18:55.425 --> 18:58.053
Looks like you ordered enough for an entire family.

228
18:58.804 --> 19:00.472
Do you see a family here?

229
19:08.021 --> 19:09.189
Do you want to talk about it?

230
19:09.273 --> 19:10.566
No.

231
19:20.993 --> 19:22.369
I'm such an idiot.

232
19:23.120 --> 19:25.289
I knew you wanted to talk about it.

233
19:31.962 --> 19:33.338
I don't understand.

234
19:36.216 --> 19:38.010
We went on so many dates.

235
19:38.594 --> 19:41.054
We talked about so many things.

236
19:42.931 --> 19:45.475
I still don't know who he was.

237
19:45.559 --> 19:47.227
Who he really was.

238
19:48.770 --> 19:50.981
Some part of it must've been real.

239
19:51.857 --> 19:54.401
Surely not all of it was a lie.

240
19:57.696 --> 19:59.156
He liked to make plans.

241
19:59.781 --> 20:00.824
Sianong?

242
20:04.369 --> 20:06.205
He even made a list

243
20:07.080 --> 20:09.082
of all the places he wanted to visit.

244
20:10.500 --> 20:11.960
I even told him,

245
20:12.586 --> 20:14.004
for our VL,

246
20:14.087 --> 20:16.715
he might as well turn it into a project management plan.

247
20:21.345 --> 20:22.429
What?

248
20:29.394 --> 20:30.646
Definitely Italy.

249
20:37.903 --> 20:39.071
What do you mean by that?

250
20:44.326 --> 20:45.827
I thought you'd say New Zealand.

251
20:49.998 --> 20:51.750
So what are you going to do in Italy?

252
20:52.334 --> 20:53.377
So many things!

253
20:58.048 --> 20:59.424
You already have an itinerary!

254
20:59.508 --> 21:01.134
It's not an itinerary.

255
21:01.218 --> 21:02.386
It's a preliminary plan!

256
21:03.887 --> 21:04.846
That's even worse!

257
21:06.765 --> 21:09.643
No. I have some friends there too.

258
21:16.024 --> 21:17.484
Castellanis?

259
21:17.985 --> 21:18.944
Fancy!

260
21:19.611 --> 21:20.779
Don't worry.

261
21:21.488 --> 21:24.032
One day, I'll take you there.

262
21:26.451 --> 21:27.411
Really?

263
21:29.621 --> 21:30.664
How about now!

264
21:37.796 --> 21:39.006
Castellani.

265
21:40.007 --> 21:41.049
What?

266
21:42.467 --> 21:43.885
Castellani!

267
21:47.848 --> 21:50.267
Hey, wait. Who's paying for this?

268
21:54.062 --> 21:54.896
I've figured it out.

269
21:56.106 --> 21:57.274
Carlota?

270
21:57.357 --> 21:59.276
Now I know why in Italy.

271
21:59.901 --> 22:00.902
Why?

272
22:00.986 --> 22:02.821
Sianong has friends there.

273
22:03.697 --> 22:05.240
The Castellanis.

274
22:05.324 --> 22:06.700
Castellani?

275
22:08.702 --> 22:10.454
The last thing he told me

276
22:11.121 --> 22:14.458
was that he wanted to go to Italy because he wanted to visit them.

277
22:15.334 --> 22:17.461
If that's Sianong's last clue to us,

278
22:18.628 --> 22:21.548
those are the people he wants us to find.

279
22:53.121 --> 22:55.874
I have news about the Castellani.

280
23:28.031 --> 23:31.952
it's impossible that we can persuade her to come back to our country.

281
23:32.035 --> 23:35.455
Didn't we agree to bring Chiara Valtrovi back?

282
23:39.209 --> 23:40.085
What's the problem?

283
23:43.088 --> 23:43.964
What did they say?

284
23:44.047 --> 23:47.050
They wanted to meet me. ASAP.

285
23:47.134 --> 23:49.302
You know those Castellanis. They are cunning.

286
23:49.386 --> 23:51.429
They're cunning? That's their reputation.

287
23:51.513 --> 23:52.639
We won't back out.

288
24:06.903 --> 24:07.821
I know they are in Italy.

289
24:07.904 --> 24:10.157
But Italy is too big, and I don't have enough time.

290
24:10.240 --> 24:12.576
If I have to know something as soon as possible,

291
24:12.659 --> 24:13.827
then tell me now.

292
24:22.878 --> 24:24.379
Do not go, please.

293
24:29.009 --> 24:33.263
I'm sure all of them are waiting to see how I will handle this.
